    "created_at": "2016-06-06T19:10:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-06T19:10:54Z",
    "body": "The difference between scope-contained and scope-filtered isn't germane to this issue; both of them consider the scoping element to be in scope.  The difference is just whether the _entire_ selector has to match inside the scope (scope-contained) or if only the final selected element has to be inside the scope (scope-filtered).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
