    "created_at": "2016-06-08T13:54:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-08T13:54:33Z",
    "body": "So step 3 of https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#scope-match-a-selectors-string needs to change to store the result in variable and then remove any instances of _node_ from that variable and then return that variable?\n\nWhy does DOM need to handle this and not SELECTORS? Does SELECTORS have other callers that want this kind of behavior?\n",
