    "updated_at": "2016-06-09T07:44:24Z",
    "body": "Hmm, so `<style scoped>` is gone. And `query()` uses https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#match-a-relative-selectors-string (I forgot to comment out that algorithm when commenting out `query()`) which passes different arguments to the algorithm. So either there are more entry points or we should adjust the algorithm a bit?\n",
