    "created_at": "2016-06-09T21:30:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-09T21:31:01Z",
    "body": "Okay, done. I cut the concepts of \"scope-contained\" and \"scope-filtered\", so now there's just \"scoped\". And scoping doesn't include the scoping element, just its descendants.\n",
